                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The challenge of controlling two goats at once is driving me nuts, in a good way. The control \"feel\" is spot on. It just works. If you fail, you know it's your own fault. So guess what, if you're anything like me, you go back and try again.. and again. Most times getting a little bit further than before (unless you get too cock-sure of yourself on the early bits, and fail)\nI've now decided that failing is good. As long as it's with Goats!\n\nFirst Goat clearled level easily,\nSecond Goat followed\nCo-ordinating 2 goats thorugh the next level, saw one had to duck while the other needed to jump.\nDid the exact opposite\nOne Goat knocked out cold, the other swimming for safety\nNearly fell off my chair laughing\n\n17/10",
